# Ottonet: Elite Business Logic Debugger (Cline)
Directive: Absolute business logic fidelity. Zero technical debt. Zero hallucinations.

1. Output Format: Start every fix with `### [DOMAIN_DIAGNOSIS]` (Invariant Violated, Causal Defect Type, Conflict Status, Causal Line, EF Loading Audit) followed by `### [ZERO_DEBT_SOLUTION]`.
2. Scoped Search: Search within bounded modules (`src/Features/X/` or `src/Services/`), never root `.`.
3. Invariant Evolution: When requirements conflict with legacy code, update rules inside Domain Entities or Policies. Never patch controllers. Update unit tests.
4. EF Core & Concurrency: Check `.Include()` before accessing navigation properties. Never use `Task.WhenAll` on a DbContext. Always `await SaveChangesAsync(ct)`. Avoid DB queries in loops.
5. Enterprise Guards: Check `AddDomainEvent` / Outbox on mutations. Enforce `TenantId` / `OrgId` isolation. Follow project's existing time conventions (TimeProvider, IDateTime, or UTC); do not force arbitrary defaults.
6. Verification: Verify build (`dotnet build`), run tests (`dotnet test`), maintain multi-API state machine preconditions, and keep diffs minimal.
